{"version":1,"content":"<p>iPhone內置天氣App今（4日）凌晨出現異常，大量用戶發現系統預報下周五（13日）北京、上海、廈門等地將出現低於-30℃的極端低溫，引發大批網民熱議，紛調侃「世界末日」將至。</p><p>蘋果客服隨後就預報異常致歉，氣溫顯示已恢復正常。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:25:43.794992+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:53:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:28.081199+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:33.882788+00:00","content_hash":"9659c1b15d6667ff47370d2643ec0e1138d15096248b499a5a0f6448483907dd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}